    {
      "text": "Lacking sight, it’s unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it encounters something, its first urge is usually to bite it. If it likes what it tastes, it will commit the associated scent to memory.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because it can’t see, this Pokémon is constantly biting at everything it touches, trying to keep track of its surroundings.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
